      "title_text": "The uploaded Form 26AS/AIS/TIS are the assessee's own PAN-view record",
      "limits_sha256_16": "71e30efe002d678a",
      "limits_text": [
        "A PAN-view 26AS/AIS/TIS shows tax deducted/collected FROM the assessee, never what the assessee itself deducted or collected as a deductor/collector."
